{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aberrant/1194074-aberrant-timeline","id":1194074,"title":"Aberrant timeline","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","The Trinity Continuum","Trinity Continuum: Aberrant"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-03-10T16:00:07-08:00","id":1194074,"title":"Aberrant timeline","content":"I have been thinking about Aberrant so much more lately and I can't help but think of how interesting the timeline point is. <br /> <br /> Like look all around us now. See the issues, the worries, the protests, the movements and then suddenly out of that super powered beings appear. <br /> <br /> It's how it was before but with modern social messaging. Just wow. <br /> <br /> Especially considering Novas come from all social, economic, race, gender, sexuality, religious background. <br /> <br /> Anyway I just wanted to say thumbs up to you team working on the history section cause yeah, it's going to be a doozy. Probably fun though, I know I personally enjoy making timelines and I figure so does whoever they get for it. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":661,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/661-lordheru","user":"LordHeru","date":". 03-10-2018, 09:17 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/661-lordheru","name":"LordHeru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar661_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1100"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-10T18:14:40-08:00","id":1194105,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LordHeru</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aberrant/1194074-aberrant-timeline#post1194074\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">super powered bongs appear.</div> </div> </div> </div>Unfortunately, this isn't that kind of game.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:#800000\">Ian A. A. Watson</span></b><span style=\"color:#bdc3c7\">(he/she)</span><br /> <b>Onyx Path Community Manager<br /> Trinity Continuum Content Lead</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4-ianwatson","name":"IanWatson","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4_2.png","title":"Community Manager","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1512"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-10T18:16:46-08:00","id":1194107,"title":"","content":"Damn phone and auto correct. It ruins posts. Makes things I was hoping were positive into cringe worthy comments.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/661-lordheru","name":"LordHeru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar661_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1100"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-11T01:23:42-08:00","id":1194181,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>IanWatson</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aberrant/1194074-aberrant-timeline?p=1194105#post1194105\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Unfortunately, this isn't that kind of game.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Uuuuuhhh... they produced a whole supplement based of Fear and Loathing in Las Vegas and have an in game analog of Hunter S Thompson. It most certainly IS that kind of game!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Visit me at <a href=\"http://www.bragrman.com\" target=\"_blank\"><i>Tales of Grey</i></a> - my RPG Game-Master's blog.<br /> <br /> &quot;If only I had an enemy bigger than my apathy, I could have won&quot; - <i>I gave you all,</i> Mumford &amp; Sons","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8520-capitantypo","name":"CapitanTypo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8520_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"896"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-11T05:03:58-07:00","id":1194213,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CapitanTypo</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aberrant/1194074-aberrant-timeline?p=1194181#post1194181\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Uuuuuhhh... they produced a whole supplement based of Fear and Loathing in Las Vegas and have an in game analog of Hunter S Thompson. It most certainly IS that kind of game!</div> </div> </div> </div>He NEEDS to return in 2E.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8890-nullapostle","name":"NullApostle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8890_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-12T09:46:55-07:00","id":1194559,"title":"","content":"Super-powered bongs and their mysterious mind-boggling properties aside, I am giddy with anticipation as to how they'll reflect the sweeping social reforms and or total chaos that would result from such a sudden disruption in power.<br /> <br /> Some people really do just wanna watch the world burn <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/765-darksol-aeternium","name":"Darksol-aeternium","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar765_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"392"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-12T13:40:34-07:00","id":1194618,"title":"","content":"Has there been any indication of whether the Aberrant 2E is going to update the existing setting, or are they going to have a do- over with Novas emerging sometime in the early 2020s or something?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Visit me at <a href=\"http://www.bragrman.com\" target=\"_blank\"><i>Tales of Grey</i></a> - my RPG Game-Master's blog.<br /> <br /> &quot;If only I had an enemy bigger than my apathy, I could have won&quot; - <i>I gave you all,</i> Mumford &amp; Sons","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8520-capitantypo","name":"CapitanTypo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8520_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"896"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-12T13:46:04-07:00","id":1194622,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CapitanTypo</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aberrant/1194074-aberrant-timeline?p=1194618#post1194618\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Has there been any indication of whether the Aberrant 2E is going to update the existing setting, or are they going to have a do- over with Novas emerging sometime in the early 2020s or something?</div> </div> </div> </div>N Day is in 2018 and game start is 2028.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3487-jetstream","name":"Jetstream","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3487_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"572"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-12T17:10:01-07:00","id":1194667,"title":"","content":"I tinkered a few years ago with versions of the Aberrant timeline where N-Day happened in 2001 (Portman was a 9/11 first responder, inspired by the Paragons book for Mutants &amp; Masterminds, which is itself pretty obviously Aberrant influenced) or in 2008 (being triggered by the first activation of the Large Hadron Collider).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-12T17:18:33-07:00","id":1194672,"title":"","content":"Those are both interesting dates to have it start. <br /> <br /> The first from a thematic reason, Portman erupting during 9/11 sounds like a perfect starting. It also leads to an interesting change to the workd post that moment. <br /> <br /> I also like the second, the idea of a science project like that causing world wide eruptions. It's a planetary version of the Galtea explosion.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/661-lordheru","name":"LordHeru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar661_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1100"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-13T11:13:47-07:00","id":1194904,"title":"","content":"In another thread someone gave us all a statistical breakdown of nova population distribution that (obviously) heavily favored India and China. Do we think they might go with those real-world statistics for verisimilitude, and if so will that have an effect on AEON's placement of Utopia when they finally get around to that? <br /> <br /> Come to think of it, are they still using the same iconics? Not having Thetis, Pax, Divis Mal, Mathematician and all the rest would be another big change.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/765-darksol-aeternium","name":"Darksol-aeternium","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar765_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"392"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-13T13:06:16-07:00","id":1194951,"title":"","content":"My headcanon on other regions of the world matching China and India\u2019s Nova populations was that regardless of population size, it turned out gender imbalance negatively effected eruption rates. So China and India still have huge Nova populations, but less per-baseline than the West, and between the two India\u2019s eruption stats were comparatively better than China\u2019s.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-13T13:17:05-07:00","id":1194957,"title":"","content":"We know that Divis Mal still exists both because they stated he still has arms and more accurately he still kills the Secretary General at the end of the Aberrant War. <br /> <br /> As for where they come I hope strict numbers don't get given so it's up to the ST to decide ratio. Though I do admit to liking the 6,000 number at 'present date'.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/661-lordheru","name":"LordHeru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar661_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1100"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-13T13:30:51-07:00","id":1194960,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Darksol-aeternium</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aberrant/1194074-aberrant-timeline?p=1194904#post1194904\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Come to think of it, are they still using the same iconics? Not having Thetis, Pax, Divis Mal, Mathematician and all the rest would be another big change.</div> </div> </div> </div>There is the Thetis Initiative in Aeon, so there probably is a Thetis.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4081-thomas-weinbrenner","name":"Thomas Weinbrenner","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"19"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-13T13:56:17-07:00","id":1194966,"title":"","content":"Since we know Mercer is still.. around, Styles has been name dropped, as has Raoul Orzaiz (he was the child whose kidnapping led to Archangel), I'm pretty sure the big names are still floating about, though there exact role may shift to make more comparative room for PCs to be world shaping figures.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-13T13:56:42-07:00","id":1194967,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Thomas Weinbrenner</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aberrant/1194074-aberrant-timeline?p=1194960#post1194960\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">There is the Thetis Initiative in Aeon, so there probably is a Thetis.</div> </div> </div> </div>That bit was a deliberate shout-out to all the folks who thought the central conspiracy of <i>Aberrant</i> was a bit unrealistic. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23899-topher-gerkey","name":"Topher Gerkey","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"33"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-13T14:01:36-07:00","id":1194968,"title":"","content":"Yeah, i think it's safe to say based on writer comments on this forum, that the central conspiracy of Aberrant is either gone or significantly changed (see Nova Infertility thread rather than also debating it here - suffice to say that IF Novas have widespread infertility, and IF that is intentionally orchestrated by someone, it won't be as simple as a shot Utopia's giving in health checkups).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-13T14:08:04-07:00","id":1194973,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Topher Gerkey</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aberrant/1194074-aberrant-timeline?p=1194967#post1194967\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> That bit was a deliberate shout-out to all the folks who thought the central conspiracy of <i>Aberrant</i> was a bit unrealistic. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>I'm all for deliberate shout puts, especially if they are enjoyable. (Imagine if a fed up Divis Mal walks out of an interview stating &quot;look I have arms&quot; while shaking them. Lol) <br /> <br /> But yeah it was a bit unrealistic the way portrayed. Plus I want my main PC group to not have a blatent evil operation going on. <br /> <br /> Which makes it all the more funny how I supported Teragen. Lol","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/661-lordheru","name":"LordHeru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar661_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1100"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-13T17:49:21-07:00","id":1195052,"title":"","content":"A nova survivor series, as in a TV show, where a bunch of Novas (and maybe baselines, not sure) are dropped on an island and given note to survive while being recorded. <br /> <br /> What sort of society forms could be intriguing - and scary to governments if in many of the group's the Novas one out in charge. <br /> <br /> As a rpg campaign it could be a way for diverse Novas to come together. Plus once the show is over you now have a bunch of famous Novas who know what to do if they were dropped on an island.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/661-lordheru","name":"LordHeru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar661_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1100"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-13T18:19:43-07:00","id":1195060,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LordHeru</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aberrant/1194074-aberrant-timeline?p=1194672#post1194672\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I also like the second, the idea of a science project like that causing world wide eruptions. It's a planetary version of the Galtea explosion.</div> </div> </div> </div>The timing works well with some interesting political fallout as well. The LHC was activated Sept 10 2008. In our world, the market crashed as a result of the mortage crisis fallout on Sept 29th. In this alternate timeline, the public panic from N-Day would completely obscure the preexisting reasons behind a major market downturn. This factor, combined with Senator John McCain having his usual kneejerk hawk reaction to a national security issue, while Senator Obama had his usual calm wait-and-see reaction (there was a great article that year by an English Prof comparing them to Macbeth and Hamlet), McCain ends up narrowly winning the US Presidency. Still very popular, especially internationally, Barack Obama is chosen by the UN to be the first chairman of Project Utopia (anyone not finding that unrealistic does not remember the degree of international superstar Obama had become in 2008 before the realities of governing reduced him to mere mortal in the eyes of the world).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":1098,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","user":"glamourweaver","date":". 03-13-2018, 09:46 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-13T18:24:56-07:00","id":1195064,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>glamourweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aberrant/1194074-aberrant-timeline?p=1195060#post1195060\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> The timing works well with some interesting political fallout as well. The LHC was activated Sept 10 2008. In our world, the market crashed as a result of the mortage crisis fallout on Sept 29th. In this alternate timeline, the public panic from N-Day would completely obscure the the preexisting reasons behind a major market downturn. This factor, combined with Senator John McCain having his usual kneejerk hawk reaction to a national security issue, while Senator Obama had his usual calm wait-and-see reaction (there was a great article that year by an English Prof comparing them to Macbeth and Hamlet), McCain ends up narrowly winning the US Presidency. Still very popular, especially internationally, Barack Obama is chosen by the UN to be the first chairman of Project Utopia (anyone not finding that unrealistic does not remember the degree of international superstar Obama had become in 2008 before the realities of governing reduced him to mere mortal in the eyes of the world).</div> </div> </div> </div>Interesting, very interesting. I could totally see him being picked to lead Project Utopia (I wish it has a different more Greek seeming name to fit with other Aeon divisions). Cause your right he was somewhat a superstar. Plus nothing stops him from running for office again after four or eight years leading Utopia, if he wanted to. <br /> <br /> I like your start I think it would have been a fun timeline change. <br /> <br /> By the way have ouposted the details anywhere? I wouldn't mind reading more about it. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/661-lordheru","name":"LordHeru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar661_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1100"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-13T18:44:57-07:00","id":1195066,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LordHeru</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aberrant/1194074-aberrant-timeline?p=1195064#post1195064\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> (I wish it has a different more Greek seeming name to fit with other Aeon divisions)</div> </div> </div> </div>I renamed them Project Atlas in part for that reason (also &quot;Utopia&quot; is just too on-the-nose for the black helicopter evil UN, New World Order, conspiracy theories). I thought it worked well since it a) followed the Classical Myth pattern, b) implied the image (though inaccurate the original myths) of holding up the world, c) suggest great strength and thus made sense as the preexisting name of the Aeon project dedicated to Eximorphs.<br /> <br /> I don't think I ever posted the full timeline, but I will see if I can find it in my old game notes.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-13T18:56:28-07:00","id":1195069,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>glamourweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aberrant/1194074-aberrant-timeline?p=1195066#post1195066\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I renamed them Project Atlas in part for that reason (also &amp;quot;Utopia&amp;quot; is just too on-the-nose for the black helicopter evil UN, New World Order, conspiracy theories). I thought it worked well since it a) followed the Classical Myth pattern, b) implied the image (though inaccurate the original myths) of holding up the world, c) suggest great strength and thus made sense as the preexisting name of the Aeon project dedicated to Eximorphs.<br /> <br /> I don't think I ever posted the full timeline, but I will see if I can find it in my old game notes.</div> </div> </div> </div>First Project Atlas sounds perfect. Even before I read your full paragraph I thought &quot;holding up the world what a perfect nova analogy&quot;. So yoink! <br /> <br /> Yeah Project Utopia doesn't work for multiple reasons, let alone it's darker connotations that I dislike as a point. <br /> <br /> I would be quite happy to read your notes, as I find the ideas you present quite interesting. And fun. And enjoyable.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/661-lordheru","name":"LordHeru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar661_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1100"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-13T23:21:24-07:00","id":1195149,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LordHeru</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aberrant/1194074-aberrant-timeline?p=1195064#post1195064\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Interesting, very interesting. I could totally see him being picked to lead Project Utopia (I wish it has a different more Greek seeming name to fit with other Aeon divisions). Cause your right he was somewhat a superstar. Plus nothing stops him from running for office again after four or eight years leading Utopia, if he wanted to.<br /></div> </div> </div> </div>If N-day is supposed to be this year (2018) then he could become a leader in utopia full-time at this point. His international popularity was such that I heard the French jokingly (maybe) asked if they could have him now that we're done with him, and that's just the kind of person Aeon would want heading up their utopia project or at least in control of their Diplomacy Corps.<br /> <br /> Project Atlas makes a lot of sense, I may use that from now on...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/765-darksol-aeternium","name":"Darksol-aeternium","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar765_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"392"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-19T15:32:07-07:00","id":1197355,"title":"","content":"One thing I remember from my timeline, which I haven\u2019t found a copy of yet, was that the UK did leave the EU, so called that! However in this fiction it was a reaction to closer continental integration.<br /> <br /> As the history played out, the French permanent seat on the UN Security Council became the EU seat. The Directive in this continuity answers to those 5 governments (so Germany is already included via sharing the EU seat, Japan is out as it\u2019s inclusion was always weird not being a major global intelligence player, and China is in).<br /> <br /> Brazil and India are the strongest parties lobbying for permanent seats. Officially the US supports their bids and China is the obstacle (particularly for India). Unofficially the US is no more interested in more countries with veto power than anyone else.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}